    'ctr-low':{title:'CTR looks low',start:'Do not diagnose packaging from CTR alone.',steps:['Check whether impressions expanded.','Check Browse/Search/Suggested mix and audience temperature.','Compare CTR with what this creator usually gets at the same point from a similar traffic source.','Check 0:30 or watch-time-from-impressions so a more clickable package did not hurt delivery.'],decision:'The title/thumbnail is more likely the problem when YouTube is showing the video normally or more than usual, CTR is low for this creator, and watch performance is healthy.',home:'Analytics / Learn → CLICK'},
