    'viral-next':{title:'A video went viral. What next?',start:'First decide whether it brought the audience you want.',steps:['Compare new vs returning/casual/regular direction.','Check subscriber conversion and business fit.','Look for older-video lift, own-Suggested, and end-screen follow-through.','Create a Reach video → bridge video → deeper follow-up path; repeat what worked, not blindly the surface topic.'],decision:'Double down only on the transferable mechanism if the breakout also fits the desired audience.',home:'Analytics → RETURN + Planner'},
